703	3. **Validate Queries**: Use search-tokens to understand query interpretation
704	
705	### Credit Management
706	
707	1. **Use search-host-count**: For large queries, first get a count to understand scope
708	2. **Optimize scan requests**: Group IPs/networks when possible
709	3. **Monitor usage**: Regularly check your API info
710	
711	### Alert Management
712	
713	1. **Use Descriptive Names**: Name alerts clearly for easy management
714	2. **Prioritize Critical Assets**: Focus monitoring on high-value systems
715	3. **Set Appropriate Expirations**: Use the expires parameter for temporary monitoring
