2593	   - Document software versions
2594	   - Note unusual configurations
2595	   - Highlight potential security implications
2596	
2597	3. Detailed Investigation
2598	   - Sample specific hosts for deeper analysis
2599	   - Check for known vulnerabilities
2600	   - Document interesting banners or metadata
2601	   - Note any concerning exposures
2602	
2603	4. Summary Report
